OL,5,G0100 Great American Railroad Journeys
OL,6,     FManhattan Island: Michael Portillo
OL,7,     Fbegins his American odyssey in New
OL,8,     FYork City, starting at Grand
OL,9,     FCentral Terminal.
OL,10,G0200 Great American Railroad Journeys
OL,11,     FBrooklyn to Montauk: Michael
OL,12,     FPortillo heads east from Manhattan
OL,13,     Fto Brooklyn, and takes the Long
OL,14,     FIsland Railroad to Queens.
OL,15,G0300 Great American Railroad Journeys
OL,16,     FNew York City to Albany: Michael
OL,17,     FPortillo follows America's iconic
OL,18,     FRiver Hudson, beginning at New
OL,19,     FYork City's Penn Station, before
OL,20,     Fsampling ale and meeting the State
OL,21,     FSenator in Albany.
